  "priorExpiration": "2015-07-31",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Puc 1801.08 “Residential building,” as referenced in RSA 155-D:3, II, means:\n\n(a) Any detached one or 2 family dwelling;\n\n(b) Any other dwelling three stories or less in height; and\n\n(c) Any other structure 3 stories or less in height and less than 4,000 square feet in gross floor area.\n\nSource. #6879, eff 2-1-99, EXPIRED: 2-1-07\n\nNew. #8811, INTERIM, eff 2-2-07, EXPIRED: 8-1-07\n\nNew. #8958, eff 7-31-07, EXPIRED: 7-31-15 (formerly Puc 1801.10)\n\nNew. #10908, eff 8-8-15",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/puc1800.html"
